Z||000008||AusFiero||12-13-2001||02:34 AM||||I used to work with race and sports cars when I was younger so I got to drive some pretty exotic stuff. Only because I was in charge of the workshop because the boss had 2 careers  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Including:<BR>Lamboghini Countach<BR>Lamborghini Uracco<BR>Ferrari Dino<BR>Ferrari 308 GTS<BR>Ferrari 328<BR>Maseratti coupe of unknown model<BR>Most model Porsches up to 1985 models<BR>Lotus Elan<BR>Lotus Super 7<BR>Lotus, unknown model but rare.<BR>Various Race cars including sports sedans, touring cars and open wheelers. Formula Ford and such.<BR>Have owned a Subaru WRX turbo and a Magna Sports with tiptronic transmission and stuff. Now I don't get to drive my burnt t-topped 86 GT but I do get around in my series II MR2 quite a bit. The wifes 1999 ex cop car is fun too.<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero3.gif">       <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
