Z||000044||PK||12-16-2001||07:35 AM||||Here's probably the worst car ever made in the UK...the Austin Metro.  The standard version had a 1000cc 73bhp engine (when it worked).<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rover_1.gif"> <P>Austin then teamed up with the Williams F1 team to produce a rally version.  They ripped out the back seats and stuck in a V6 producing 410hp and made it 4WD.  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/6r4.jpg"> <P>OK so its not exotic and is still pug ugly but it is the fastest thing I've ever sat in!<P>Cheers<BR>PK<P><BR>||||reg||1
